SekoWord ("the application") is an educational mobile application
designed to improve English listening and pronunciation skills.

## Information We Collect
SekoWord does not request or collect personal information such as
name, email address, location, contacts, or photos.

The application may automatically collect anonymous technical data,
including:
- Device type and operating system
- App version
- Crash and error reports
- General usage statistics

This data cannot be used to identify individual users.

## How We Use Information
Collected data is used only to:
- Improve application performance
- Detect and fix technical issues
- Enhance user experience

## Third-Party Services
SekoWord may use third-party services such as:
- Google Play Services
- Firebase Analytics
- Firebase Crashlytics

These services may collect information in accordance with their own
privacy policies.

## Advertisements
SekoWord does not display personalized advertisements.
If ads are shown, they may use anonymous identifiers.

## Data Security
We take reasonable measures to protect user data.
However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure.

## Children's Privacy
SekoWord does not knowingly collect personal information from children
under the age of 13.

## Changes to This Policy
This privacy policy may be updated from time to time.
Any changes will be published on this page.

